          "legendFormat": "{{datasource}} max used",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "Keycloak queries PostgreSQL on every token it issues, and since 2026-10-29 both live on serverwely1 — this pool is the link between them. `max used` is the high-water mark since start: if it reaches the pool size, the next panel fills.",
